menu "Resilient IoT Edge"

    config RIE_EMERGENCY_MIN_BUFFER_HOURS
        int "Guaranteed minimum buffer duration in EMERGENCY (hours)"
        default 8
        range 1 168
        help
            The firmware calculates the required write interval to
            guarantee this minimum duration before the local buffer (LittleFS)
            starts dropping data, based on the partition size.

endmenu